Variant type: standalone

Additional constraints:
- Skill-load refs reframed as plain recommendations (target: generic tool-less chat).
- Handoff doc opens with the `created-at` block, then a tool-access notice instructing the reader
  to suggest skills and tools and to ask the user.
- `$created_at` taken from context when available, else current local time; `T0000` when only
  a date is known.
- Declared exception to the inline-output default: writes the handoff to a local file
  when a file tool is available, else emits it inline.